                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN, VORRICHTUNG UND SYSTEM ZUR ERKENNUNG VON SCHLAFSTADIEN EINER PERSON</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ, APPAREIL ET SYSTÈME DE DÉTECTION DE STADES DE SOMMEIL D'UNE PERSONNE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD, APPARATUS, AND SYSTEM FOR DETECTING STAGES OF SLEEP OF PERSON</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure describes a method and an apparatus for detecting stages of sleep of a person. The method comprises receiving temperature data and heart rate data of the person, determining temperature variability on the basis of the temperature data and determining heart rate variability (HRV) on the basis of the heart rate data, and detecting stages of sleep of the person on the basis of the temperature variability and the heart rate variability.</p>
